  "evidence_directory": "out/service-extensions/xredis-sentinel-active-refresh-20261118",
  "scope": "Coalesced explicit topology hints and opt-in periodic Sentinel revalidation in native master and replica pools.",
  "cases": [
    "Master refresh hint and replica periodic revalidation fence still-live old leases.",
    "Thirty-two hints during an in-flight query schedule one follow-up; unchanged verified endpoint keeps old lease.",
    "Malformed query and wrong target ROLE preserve the existing generation with typed failure status.",
    "Disabling the timer stops future periodic probes and keeps manual admission available.",
    "Required refill preempts a hanging optional query; close and Notify reentry wait for physical closure.",
    "Real Redis master remap preserves the old socket, server role and blocked command up to the hint.",
    "Real failover in the original default mode regressions cover both master and replica pools."
  ],
